      "title": "How To Use",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# V0 Five-Case Test\n\nUse this same graph for S001-S005.\n\n1. Paste the before-image prompt into `BEFORE PROMPT`.\n2. Queue only the BEFORE lane first and save the flawed image.\n3. Send the image plus shot-object JSON to the LLM critic.\n4. Paste the accepted revision guidance into `REVISION PROMPT`.\n5. Load the before image in `LOAD BEFORE IMAGE FOR REVISION`.\n6. Queue the REVISION lane.\n7. Judge the before/after pair: better_against_intent, preserve_violations, avoid_violations.\n\nKeep batch size 1 on the RTX 3080 10 GB."
      ]
    },
