      "widgets_values": [
        "# Judgment Packet\n\nAfter each case, record:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"shot_id\": \"S00X\",\n  \"better_against_intent\": true,\n  \"preserve_violations\": [],\n  \"avoid_violations\": [],\n  \"notes\": \"\"\n}\n```\n\nPass threshold for V0: 3 of 5 improve with zero preserve/avoid violations.\n\nIf a revision improves the image but loses Mara's hood, case, shoulder light, pose, framing, or world, mark it as a preserve violation."
      ]
